      "writtenOn": "2017-10-18T10:16:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In CR1 the interesting bits are:\n28: M1: Word length\n12: M0: Word length\n10/9: Parity stuff\n\nIn CR2:\n31:24: Address\n22:20: Auto-baud\n19: MSB first\n18-16: Inversion stuff\n15: LIN mode\n11-8: SCLK stuff\n4: Address\n\nIn CR3:\n3: Half-duplex selection\n\nSo yeah, a bit too many bits to fit in a single int...",
